<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>새:공간 — 원도심 빈 공간, 하루만 열어보세요</title>
<meta name="description" content="원도심 유휴공간을 하루부터 한 달까지. 보증금·장기계약 없이 팝업·소모임을 열어보세요. 부천 원종동." />
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='7' fill='%233A5A40'/%3E%3Ctext x='16' y='22' font-size='16' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23D8B24C' font-family='sans-serif' font-weight='bold'%3E새%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css" />
<style>
:root{
  --green:#3A5A40; --green-dark:#2C4A3E; --green-soft:#E9EFE8;
  --orange:#E07A5F; --orange-dark:#C9694F;
  --yellow:#D8B24C; --yellow-soft:#F4EEC9;
  --bg:#F8F7F2; --surface:#FFFFFF;
  --ink:#2A2A28; --muted:#6B6B63; --line:#E7E4DA;
  --radius:14px;
  --shadow-soft:0 1px 2px rgba(32,36,42,.05),0 8px 24px rgba(32,36,42,.06);
  --shadow-lift:0 8px 16px rgba(32,36,42,.08),0 20px 44px rgba(32,36,42,.10);
  --font:"Pretendard Variable",Pretendard,"Noto Sans KR",system-ui,sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
body{
  background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--font);
  word-break:keep-all; overflow-wrap:anywhere; line-height:1.55; font-size:16px;
}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}
.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
.icn{width:1em;height:1em;display:inline-block;vertical-align:-.125em;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}

/* Header */
header.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;background:rgba(252,253,251,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.hbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:60px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.logoimg{height:38px;width:auto;display:block}
.logo .mark{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--green);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#F4F1DE;font-weight:800;font-size:15px}
.loc{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;font-weight:600}

/* Tabs */
.tabs{position:sticky;top:60px;z-index:39;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.tabrow{display:flex;gap:4px}
.tab{appearance:none;border:none;background:none;padding:14px 6px;margin-right:22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);border-bottom:3px solid transparent;transition:color .15s}
.tab.active{color:var(--green);border-bottom-color:var(--green)}
.panel{display:none;animation:fade .25s ease}
.panel.active{display:block}
@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

/* Buttons */
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:none;border-radius:11px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;padding:13px 20px;transition:transform .12s,box-shadow .15s,background .15s;text-decoration:none;justify-content:center}
.btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--orange);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(201,105,79,.28)}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--orange-dark)}
.btn-primary:disabled{background:#E7C9B3;color:#fff;box-shadow:none;cursor:not-allowed}
.btn-outline{background:#fff;color:var(--green-dark);border:1.5px solid var(--green)}
.btn-outline:hover{background:var(--green-soft)}
.btn-ghost{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green-dark)}
.btn-kakao{background:#FEE500;color:#3A1D1D}
.btn-lg{padding:15px 24px;font-size:16px}
.btn-full{width:100%}

/* Hero */
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center;background-image:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(248,247,242,.97) 0%,rgba(248,247,242,.92) 36%,rgba(248,247,242,.62) 54%,rgba(248,247,242,.3) 76%,rgba(248,247,242,.18) 100%),url('hero.jpg');background-size:cover;background-position:center right;background-repeat:no-repeat}
.hero .wrap{width:100%}
.hero-inner{max-width:520px;padding:48px 0}
.hero .eyebrow{color:var(--green);font-weight:800;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:14px}
.hero h1{font-size:40px;line-height:1.22;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 16px}
.hl{background:linear-gradient(transparent 58%,#EFE7CD 58%);color:var(--green-dark);padding:0 3px;border-radius:2px}
.hero p.sub{font-size:18px;color:#4B5158;margin:0 0 28px;max-width:600px}
.hero .cta-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-badges{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:26px}
.chip{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#495057;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.chip .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green)}

/* Sections */
section.blk{padding:52px 0}
.blk.warm{background:var(--yellow-soft)}
.blk.greenbg{background:var(--green-soft)}
.sec-eyebrow{color:var(--orange-dark);font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.03em;margin-bottom:10px}
.sec-title{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 10px}
.sec-lead{color:#495057;font-size:16px;max-width:640px;margin:0}
.stat-viz{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;margin-top:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px 26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);flex-wrap:wrap}
.donut{position:relative;width:132px;height:132px;flex:none}
.donut svg{width:132px;height:132px;transform:rotate(-90deg)}
.donut .track{fill:none;stroke:#EFE7CD;stroke-width:13}
.donut .prog{fill:none;stroke:var(--green);stroke-width:13;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-dasharray:327;stroke-dashoffset:327;transition:stroke-dashoffset 1.4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
.donut-num{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;color:var(--green-dark);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;line-height:1}
.stat-txt{flex:1;min-width:220px}
.stat-txt b{font-size:23px;display:block;margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.stat-txt p{margin:0;color:#495057;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
.stat-txt p .src{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

/* Solution */
.sol-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:24px}
.sol-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.sol-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift)}
.sol-card::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:5px}
.sc-green::before{background:var(--green)}
.sc-orange::before{background:var(--orange)}
.sc-ico{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:15px;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:14px}
.sc-ico .icn{width:27px;height:27px;stroke-width:2}
.sc-green .sc-ico{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green)}
.sc-orange .sc-ico{background:#F7E7DF;color:var(--orange-dark)}
.sc-tag{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted)}
.sol-card h3{margin:5px 0 8px;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.sol-card p{margin:0 0 14px;color:#495057;font-size:15px}
.sc-chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.sc-chips span{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#495057}

/* Steps */
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:24px;counter-reset:s}
.step{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px 18px;position:relative}
.step .num{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-weight:800;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:12px}
.step h4{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:16px}
.step p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

/* Program teaser */
.teaser{background:#fff;border:1.5px dashed var(--green);border-radius:18px;padding:26px;display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.teaser .body{flex:1;min-width:240px}
.teaser h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px}
.teaser ul{margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:#495057}
.teaser .art{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--yellow-soft);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--orange-dark);font-weight:800;text-align:center;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.soonpill{display:inline-block;background:var(--orange);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:10px}

/* Trust */
.team{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:22px}
.member{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 14px;text-align:center;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.member:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift)}
.member .ava{width:78px;height:78px;margin:0 auto 12px}
.member .ava svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.member b{display:block;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.member .role{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.35}
.member .rtag{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px}
.rtag.g{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green-dark)}
.rtag.o{background:#F7E7DF;color:var(--orange-dark)}
.rtag.y{background:#F4EEC9;color:#8a6d1e}
.partners{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:22px}
.partner{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:9px 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#495057}
.rebadge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:18px;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px}
details.faq{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:0 16px;margin-top:10px}
details.faq summary{padding:15px 0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:15px}
details.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
details.faq[open] summary{color:var(--green)}
details.faq p{margin:0 0 15px;color:#495057;font-size:14px}

/* Spaces */
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:8px}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift)}
.card .thumb{aspect-ratio:16/10;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--green-soft),var(--yellow-soft));display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--green-dark);font-weight:700;position:relative}
.card .thumbtags{position:absolute;top:10px;left:10px;right:10px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.card .badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);border:1px solid var(--line);color:#495057;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px}
.card .tagchip{background:rgba(58,90,64,.92);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px}
.card .body{padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;flex:1}
.card h3{margin:0;font-size:17px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.card .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.card .meta span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.card .price{margin-top:2px;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.card .price small{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;font-size:12px}
.card .cardbtn{margin-top:auto}

/* Filters */
.filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 22px}
.filt{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#495057;transition:.15s}
.filt.on{background:var(--green);color:#fff;border-color:var(--green)}
.filt:hover:not(.on){border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green-dark)}

/* Modal */
.overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,24,28,.5);z-index:60;display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}
.overlay.open{display:flex}
.dialog{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;max-width:560px;width:100%;max-height:90vh;overflow:auto;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);position:relative}
.dialog .close{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;z-index:2}
.dhead{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--green-soft),var(--yellow-soft));padding:28px 22px 22px}
.dhead h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.dhead .meta{display:flex;gap:14px;color:#495057;font-size:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.dhead .dtags{margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.dhead .dtags span{background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green-dark);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px}
.dbody{padding:22px}
.dlabel{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.02em;margin:22px 0 10px;text-transform:none}
.dlabel:first-child{margin-top:0}
.toggle{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0;background:#F1F3F0;border-radius:12px;padding:4px}
.toggle button{border:none;background:none;padding:11px 8px;border-radius:9px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);transition:.15s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px}
.toggle button.on{background:var(--green);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(58,90,64,.32)}
.checklist{list-style:none;margin:14px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}
.checklist li{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;font-size:14px;color:#343A40}
.checklist li .ic{color:var(--green);flex:none;margin-top:2px}
.onsite{margin-top:12px;background:var(--yellow-soft);border:1px solid #E6D8A5;border-radius:11px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:13px;color:#5c4b00}
.onsite label{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
.onsite .note{display:block;color:#8a7320;margin-top:4px;font-weight:500}
.datewrap input[type=date]{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;font-family:inherit;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink)}
.datehint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}
.datehint.warn{color:var(--orange-dark);font-weight:600}
.pricebox{background:#F8FAF7;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-top:6px}
.pricerow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:14px;color:#495057;padding:3px 0}
.pricerow.total{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:6px;padding-top:10px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);font-size:17px}
.pricerow .n{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.applybtn{margin-top:18px}
.applyhint{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

/* success */
.success{padding:34px 24px;text-align:center}
.success .ok{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green);display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 16px}
.success h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:22px}
.success p{color:#495057;margin:0 0 20px}
.success .btn{margin:0 auto}

/* Footer */
footer.site{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 0;margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.frow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center}
.flinks{display:flex;gap:16px}
.flinks a{color:var(--green-dark);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
.slink{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.slink svg{width:19px;height:19px}
.slink:hover{color:var(--green)}

/* Responsive */
@media(max-width:860px){
  .grid,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .sol-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  .hero{min-height:auto;display:block;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(248,247,242,.96) 0%,rgba(248,247,242,.9) 42%,rgba(248,247,242,.6) 70%,rgba(248,247,242,.35) 100%),url('hero.jpg');background-position:center}
  .hero-inner{padding:40px 0 200px}
  .hero h1{font-size:31px}
  .hero p.sub{font-size:16px}
  .grid,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .member{padding:16px 7px}
  .member .ava{width:58px;height:58px;margin-bottom:8px}
  .member b{font-size:13.5px}
  .member .role{font-size:11px}
  .step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;text-align:left;padding:16px}
  .step .num{margin-bottom:0;flex:none}
  .step-txt{flex:1}
  .overlay{padding:0;align-items:flex-end}
  .dialog{max-width:100%;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;max-height:94vh}
  .sec-title{font-size:22px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<header class="site">
  <div class="wrap hbar">
    <a class="logo" href="#" onclick="switchTab('intro');return false;" aria-label="새공간 홈"><img class="logoimg" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="새공간" /></a>
    <div class="loc">
      <svg class="icn" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
      부천 원종동
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- TABS -->
<nav class="tabs">
  <div class="wrap tabrow">
    <button class="tab active" data-tab="intro" onclick="switchTab('intro')">사업소개</button>
    <button class="tab" data-tab="spaces" onclick="switchTab('spaces')">공간·신청</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ============ TAB 1: 사업소개 ============ -->
<main class="panel active" id="panel-intro">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="eyebrow">원도심 빈 공간 × 청년의 실험</div>
        <h1>메모장 속 '언젠가 해볼 것',<br><span class="hl">이번엔 열어요.</span></h1>
        <p class="sub">보증금도 1년 계약도 없이, 하루부터 한 달까지. 원도심 빈 공간을 팝업·소모임·전시 공간으로 빌려보세요.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" onclick="switchTab('spaces')">이번 주 열 수 있는 공간 보기
            <svg class="icn" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>하루 단위 대여</span>
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>보증금 없음</span>
          <span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>홍보·운영 지원</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk warm">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-eyebrow">이런 적 있으셨죠</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title">아이디어는 있는데, '어떻게 시작하지'에서 늘 멈췄어요.</h2>
      <p class="sec-lead">플리마켓, 원데이 클래스, 작은 전시… 해보고 싶은 건 많은데 공간·비용·사람 모으기가 막막해서 미뤄두셨다면. 그 문턱, 저희가 낮춰둘게요.</p>
      <div class="stat-viz">
        <div class="donut">
